stic bag. She kept the manual for 30 years after the machine was gone. When I asked my brother why she did that, he said, In case. In case of what? Nobody knew. That is the voice of paper. In case. Here is how I sort them. First, any manual for a machine that is no longer in the house goes immediately. Then,", "words": [{"w": " All", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": " of", "s": 0.22, "e": 0.44}, {"w": " them,", "s": 0.44, "e": 0.94}, {"w": " almost.", "s": 0.94, "e": 1.98}, {"w": " In", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.12}, {"w": " every", "s": 2.12, "e": 2.46}, {"w": " house", "s": 2.46, "e": 2.76}, {"w": " in", "s": 2.76, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " America,", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.58}, {"w": " there", "s": 3.58, "e": 3.66}, {"w": " is", "s": 3.66, "e": 3.86}, {"w": " a", "s": 3.86, "e": 3.98}, {"w": " drawer", "s": 3.98, "e": 4.3}, {"w": " of", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.54}, {"w": " instruction", "s": 4.54, "e": 5.04}, {"w": " books.", "s": 5.04, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " The", "s": 5.98, "e": 6.08}, {"w": " blender,", "s": 6.08, "e": 6.96}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.08}, {"w": " microwave,", "s": 7.08, "e": 8.12}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.12, "e": 8.2}, {"w": " television", "s": 8.2, "e": 8.76}, {"w": " you", "s": 8.76, "e": 9.0}, {"w": " replaced", "s": 9.0, "e": 9.46}, {"w": " in", "s": 9.46, "e": 9.74}, {"w": " 2009,", "s": 9.74, "e": 10.8}, {"w": " the", "s": 11.54, "e": 11.64}, {"w": " garage", "s": 11.64, "e": 12.12}, {"w": " door", "s": 12.12, "e": 12.38}, {"w": " opener", "s": 12.38, "e": 12.8}, {"w": " from", "s": 12.8, "e": 13.04}, {"w": " the", "s": 13.04, "e": 13.22}, {"w": " house", "s": 13.22, "e": 13.44}, {"w": " you", "s": 13.44, "e": 13.6}, {"w": " sold.", "s": 13.6, "e": 13.96}, {"w": " I", "s": 14.52, "e": 14.66}, {"w": " counted", "s": 14.66, "e": 15.04}, {"w": " mine", "s": 15.04, "e": 15.38}, {"w": " the", "s": 15.38, "e": 15.54}, {"w": " first", "s": 15.54, "e": 15.82}, {"w": " time.", "s": 15.82, "e": 16.7}, {"w": " 56", "s": 16.78, "e": 17.28}, {"w": " manuals,", "s": 17.28, "e": 18